# Real bank/marketplace exports, for testing an importer against actual data.
# Ignored wholesale, including anything nested, because the contents are
# unredacted personal data: a C24 or Comdirect CSV carries IBANs, counterparty
# names and payment purposes, and an Amazon order export carries recipient
# addresses. Repo fixtures are synthetic by rule — put a real export here, not
# next to the tests. `.gitkeep` is the one tracked file, so the directory
# exists in a fresh clone and nobody has to guess the path.
/local-data/**
!/local-data/.gitkeep
